                        <h2><span style="color: #ffffff;">Tuition-Free College for Adults</span></h2>
                        
                        <p>If you’re 25 or older, the Michigan Reconnect program may allow you to attend Glen
                           Oaks Community College tuition-free. Gain new skills, earn a degree or certificate,
                           and open the door to better career opportunities. It’s never too late to take the
                           next step.</p>
                        
                        <p><span> </span> <a class="btn btn-default btn-white" title="Michigan Reconnect" href="/cost-aid/financial-aid/types-of-aid/scholarships/michigan-reconnect.php" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Learn About Michigan Reconnect</a></p>
                        </div>
                  </div>
