                  <div class="col-md-6 fullwidth-split-text">
                     <div class="text-wrapper">
                        
                        <h2>Start College Tuition-Free After High School</h2>
                        
                        <p>Eligible Michigan high school graduates and students who have earned a GED can attend
                           Glen Oaks tuition-free through the Michigan Community College Guarantee.</p>
                        
                        <p><a class="btn btn-default" title="Get Started" href="/cost-aid/financial-aid/types-of-aid/scholarships/michigan-community-college-guarantee.php" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Learn About the Michigan Community College Guarantee</a></p>
                        </div>
                  </div>
